' Secondary dependencies: creations, and the calls that carry a game rule or appear in the sequence diagram.
' Plain getter reads (for example StatusView formatting the state) are not drawn.
' Included by class-diagram.puml and the detail pages; the overview leaves them out to stay readable.
!if $links_boundary
Main ..> GameController : <<use>>
Main ..> InputEndedException : <<catch>>
GameCLI ..> InputEndedException : <<throw>>
GameCLI ..> Restaurant : <<use>>
GameCLI ..> WaiterTask : <<use>>
GameCLI ..> Seating : <<create>>
!endif
!if $links_control
GameController ..> HappyHour : <<use>>
GameController ..> TurnLog : <<use>>
ArrivalSchedule ..> RegularCustomer : <<create>>
ArrivalSchedule ..> VIPCustomer : <<create>>
ArrivalSchedule ..> CriticCustomer : <<create>>
!endif
!if $links_restaurant
Host ..> Restaurant : <<use>>
Waiter ..> Restaurant : <<use>>
Cashier ..> Restaurant : <<use>>
Cashier ..> Customer : <<use>>
Cashier ..> Order : <<use>>
Cashier ..> TurnLog : <<use>>
Chef ..> Order : <<use>>
!endif
!if $links_orders
Customer ..> Menu : <<use>>
Customer ..> MenuItem : <<use>>
CriticCustomer ..> TurnLog : <<use>>
!endif
